    <h2>The DQ Chili Cheese Dog — A Classic American Combination</h2>
  <p>The DQ Chili Cheese Dog is the simplest great thing on the DQ food menu. An all-beef hot dog in a steamed bun, topped with hearty DQ chili and melted cheese sauce — three ingredients working in perfect harmony at $4.99. It is also the best value on the <a href="/categories/burgers-sandwiches">Burgers &amp; Sandwiches</a> menu from a price-per-calorie perspective. See the full DQ food lineup on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
